Assistant: I notice that the error message actually refers to a different file (TeamsCTA-11b728d3.tsx) that's trying to import from "@calcom/features/i18n". However, since we're working with the InsightsRoutingFormResponsesPage preview component, we should make sure this component has all the necessary providers.

Let's modify the preview component to include a mock I18nProvider to handle any i18n dependencies that might be needed by child components:

<file path="apps/web/.temp/dessn-component-routes/InsightsRoutingFormResponsesPage-9e81ca6c.tsx">
